   168	    """The categorisation table the memo's figures came from. A review drafted before the
   169	    table moved to data (a pending checkpoint from an older version) has none in its state;
   170	    its lines were categorised by the table now packaged as v1, frozen and proved identical
   171	    (tests/test_rules.py, P7), so it is named as v1 and marked as inferred, never null."""
