89:- **C8 Verify** (new src/cma/verify.py). Recomputes an evidence record from its case and refuses records from another ruleset.
171:- **Data-intensive.** *Idempotency:* imports are keyed by file hash, an identical override changes nothing, and a second sign-off is refused. *Ordering and concurrency:* one writer per case, enforced by a lock plus the expected log position; a second tab gets a conflict and reloads. *Partial failure:* append-only logs with a check for a torn last entry; the pack is written to a temporary folder and then renamed. *Consistency:* the workspace reads the latest state; the preview and sign-off bind to a snapshot that includes thresholds, the policy hash and the show_policy_verdict setting, so a sign-off cannot attach to an outcome the underwriter did not see. *Migration:* additive, nothing to backfill. *Money:* integer pence, GBP only, thresholds compared in pence, and amounts with more than two decimals are refused.
218:**Rule tables.** Packaged YAML under src/cma/rules/. v1 is today's table, frozen. v2 adds acquirers, gateways, marketplaces and delivery platforms; lenders and merchant cash advance providers; wording for own pots and savings; cash paid in (counter, deposit machine, Post Office and PayPoint); cash-withdrawal wording for the round-trip indicator only; HMRC repayments; refunds; and explained non-trading credits. Tables are validated on load like the policy, and each has an id and a hash.
238:**Evidence JSON v1.** Everything in today's record, with its policy key unchanged. Added: schema_version, case id, accounts (key, source format, file hash, period, line count), ruleset id and hash, firm rules hash, thresholds hash, profile hash, overrides (sequence number, line, old and new category, reason, name, OS user, time), money-in buckets, monthly summary, indicators with the thresholds that fired, policy_check (shown or hidden, the label, the policy name and hash), snapshot hash, sign-off (name, OS user, time, notes), egress (offline, or the model's name) and package version.
307:| An evidence record was made with a different ruleset | Verify refuses and names the version that made it | R45 |
311:## Migration
330:1. Land C1 (tables as data, v1 frozen) with P7 passing before any category changes.
337:**Rollback.** For the policy check, set show_policy_verdict off. For categorisation, cash included, set CMA_RULESET=v1 or reinstall the previous wheel. Packs and evidence are immutable and record their ruleset, thresholds, policy hash, the show_policy_verdict setting and package version, so nothing needs repair. The old version leaves case folders written by the new one alone.
